  {
   "id": "gecko-gods-151312@major-2026-04-24",
   "gameId": "gecko-gods-151312",
   "displayName": "Review Milestone Update & Points Shop Community Items",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-24T17:57:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Gather round, Geckos! 🦎",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "From azure oceans to whispering sands, our newly released Steam Points Shop community items celebrate not only our game, but also the 200+ of you who’ve contributed to our 96% positive reviews!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38955380/8b351a63e7ae230415731bc45c72bf9140aaab03.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What’s On Offer?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can choose from a series of jaw-dropping backgrounds, eye-catching avatars and emotes to put a little more Gecko Gods in your Steam profile.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "How Do I Access These?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s simple! Just head to the Steam Points Shop and find Gecko Gods in the “From Your Games” section. From there, you’ll be able to use your Steam Points to grab everything we have on offer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38955380/6aa695377b1fecf4e4074d88978ee74a66a63d3e.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, be sure to follow us on X and TikTok and join our official Discord server to stay up to date with all the latest updates and announcements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Gecko Gods team 💚",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1290760/Gecko_Gods/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
